<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Login Baru Terdeteksi</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#eef3f7;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Ada login baru ke akun <%= brandName %> Anda.</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#eef3f7;padding:24px 12px;">
<tr><td align="center">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;width:100%;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(11,95,165,.12);">
<tr><td style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b5fa5 0%,#0e7a5f 60%,#16a34a 100%);padding:28px 32px;text-align:center;">
<% if (logoUrl) { %><img src="<%= logoUrl %>" alt="<%= brandName %>" style="max-height:56px;max-width:220px;margin-bottom:10px;" /><br /><% } %>
<div style="font-size:36px;line-height:1;">🔐</div>
<div style="color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin-top:6px;">Login Baru Terdeteksi</div>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;color:#0f2a43;">Halo <strong><%= userName %></strong>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#3d5469;">Akun <strong><%= userEmail %></strong> baru saja login dari perangkat yang belum pernah dipakai sebelumnya pada <strong><%= loginAt %></strong>. Jika itu Anda, tidak ada tindakan lanjutan.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 16px;background:#f2f7fb;border:1px solid #dbe7f1;border-radius:12px;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8;color:#3d5469;">
📱 Perangkat: <strong><%= deviceName %></strong><br />
🌐 IP: <strong><%= ip %></strong><br />
🧭 Browser/App: <span style="word-break:break-all;"><%= userAgent %></span>
</td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 8px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:12px;"><tr><td style="padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#7f1d1d;">
⚠️ Bukan Anda yang login? Segera ganti password lewat menu Lupa Password dan hubungi admin — akun Anda mungkin disalahgunakan.
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e6edf3;text-align:center;">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:#8aa0b4;"><strong><%= brandFull %></strong><br />Email otomatis — mohon tidak membalas langsung.<br />Butuh bantuan? Kunjungi <a href="<%= appUrl %>" style="color:#0b5fa5;"><%= appUrl %></a>.</p>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
